## 🔍 AUDITABILITY

A SuperAdmin's PII access is itself an auditable property. The following SQL query MUST return all PII access events with full context:

```sql
SELECT
  ia.created_at,
  u.email                          AS admin_email,
  ia.query_metadata->>'reason'     AS reason,
  ia.context_org_id,
  ia.context_user_id,
  ia.query_metadata->>'ticket_id'  AS ticket_id,
  ia.query_metadata->>'expires_at' AS expires_at,
  (ia.query_metadata->>'duration_min')::int AS duration_minutes
FROM public.impersonation_audit ia
LEFT JOIN auth.users u ON u.id = ia.actor_user_id
WHERE ia.action = 'support_mode_enter'
  AND ia.created_at >= now() - interval '90 days'
ORDER BY ia.created_at DESC;
```

This query feeds the monthly compliance review.

